Z||000000||WisconsinGT||03-06-2000||09:45 PM||||1. If you have a glass pak instead of a Cat. Convert. would that mean that you will never experience any of the problems that a Cat. Convert. has? i.e. clogged Cat. ect, ect.<P>2. Several people have mentioned that they have a pinging problem when using regular unleaded gas. Is this the sign of a problem? The Fiero was designed to run on reg. Unleaded. Yes?<P>3. You are following an 88GT. You are in an 88GT. You both slow down and come to a complete stop to turn left. He guns it and spins his tires. You gun it and cannot get that kind of low end power. What the hell is going on! His is a stock GT. Mine almost every bloody part from the heads up is new. His has 57,000 mine 80,000. The 2.8 had it's time but I can see why alot of you are doing engine conversions. <P>4. Why is my car's fuel mixture burning rich? I cannot get away from it. Take it to a GM dealer they hook it up to a computer and say "She's running rich." I say thanks. And try to do my own testing. New IAC Valve, Decarb kit, Accel coil, new plugs, new 02 sensor (ACDELCO), Splitfire plug wires, plugs, cap, rotor. plus a few new sensors. No luck.<P>Sorry about the vent. But I am tired of the hunt. I am hoping to see alot of you folks at the Dells run this year. I have asked to put together a CD Rom of the event. So I will be the one running around with a video camera. This leads me to my final question... How many of you folks would be interested in a CDRom about Fieros? What would you want on it? <P>Thanks,<BR>Brian||||reg||1
